</section>
<section style="background:#fff;padding:clamp(56px,7vw,100px) 20px"><div style="max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto"><h2 style="margin:0 0 20px;text-align:center;font-size:clamp(28px,3.8vw,48px);line-height:1.12;font-weight:800;color:#2B2622">Gas Line Installation</h2><div style="width:60px;height:4px;background:#BD1E2D;margin:0 auto 28px"></div><div style="max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px"><p style="margin:0;font-size:19px;line-height:1.7;color:#2B2622">Gas lines are one of the more serious parts of your commercial project. If the project is not completed properly, it could jeopardize the health of your customers and employees. A gas line that fails will cost you time and money. Fortunately, at JBG Plumbing we understand how important commercial gas line installation is.</p><p style="margin:0;font-size:19px;line-height:1.7;color:#2B2622">Our team of professionals at JBG Plumbing understand how much you've invested in this project and how much the project means to you.</p></div></div></section>
<section style="background:#F4F1EE;padding:clamp(56px,7vw,100px) 20px"><div style="max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto"><h2 style="margin:0 0 20px;text-align:center;font-size:clamp(28px,3.8vw,48px);line-height:1.12;font-weight:800;color:#2B2622">At JBG Plumbing, We Are More Than Just Plumbing</h2><div style="width:60px;height:4px;background:#BD1E2D;margin:0 auto 28px"></div><div style="max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px"><p style="margin:0;font-size:19px;line-height:1.7;color:#2B2622">We are a family-owned plumbing company that has been working in the Brazos Valley for more than 35 years. Our company has grown to work in most major Texas cities, including College Station, Houston, Austin, Dallas, and San Antonio. We pride ourselves on the fact that we've watched the community develop over the years.</p><p style="margin:0;font-size:19px;line-height:1.7;color:#2B2622">When working with us, you're working with more than plumbers. You're working with expert contractors who can be trusted to complete your commercial gas line installation. You're working with a company who wants to develop a professional friendship that will last for years to come.</p><p style="margin:0;font-size:19px;line-height:1.7;color:#2B2622">When you call us, you can rest assured that you're hiring a team of dedicated professionals that includes licensed contractors and expert technicians. Our reputation speaks for itself with other commercial property owners in the area. JBG means something special, and we work hard to ensure no one forgets that when working on your project.</p></div></div></section>
<section style="background:#fff;padding:clamp(56px,7vw,100px) 20px"><div style="max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto"><h2 style="margin:0 0 20px;text-align:center;font-size:clamp(28px,3.8vw,48px);line-height:1.12;font-weight:800;color:#2B2622">Assessing All Aspects of Your Project</h2><div style="width:60px;height:4px;background:#BD1E2D;margin:0 auto 28px"></div><div style="max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px"><p style="margin:0;font-size:19px;line-height:1.7;color:#2B2622">Our experts will make sure they fully understand the scope of your project before continuing with the installation. Gas pipe sizes directly impact the inlet pressure that's available, so it's important to understand the utilities you intend to use and the expected capacity needed to operate your gas distribution system.</p><p style="margin:0;font-size:19px;line-height:1.7;color:#2B2622">Once our team understands your appliance needs, we will determine the correct allowable pressure drop. The allowable pressure drop ensures the delivery of the proper amount of gas, in cubic feet per hour. When the correct allowable pressure drop is determined, your appliances will operate under a full load.</p><p style="margin:0;font-size:19px;line-height:1.7;color:#2B2622">Operating under a full load helps ensure that your gas distribution system is working as intended while maximizing efficiency. You save money, and your appliances operate properly when they operate under a full load. It's important that you provide an accurate description of all appliances that will connect to your gas distribution system.</p></div></div></section>
<section style="background:#F4F1EE;padding:clamp(56px,7vw,100px) 20px"><div style="max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto"><h2 style="margin:0 0 20px;text-align:center;font-size:clamp(28px,3.8vw,48px);line-height:1.12;font-weight:800;color:#2B2622">Understanding Your Financial Needs</h2><div style="width:60px;height:4px;background:#BD1E2D;margin:0 auto 28px"></div><div style="max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px"><p style="margin:0;font-size:19px;line-height:1.7;color:#2B2622">At JBG Plumbing, we will work with you to come up with the best gas line installation for your budget. We will design a system that is not only effective now but will continue to be in the future. This cost-effective system will be able to meet future business needs and increased demand, all while staying within your budget.</p><p style="margin:0;font-size:19px;line-height:1.7;color:#2B2622">You'll quickly recuperate upfront gas line costs when working with our team. We maximize efficiency and make sure that your gas distribution system is working to its full capacity.</p><p style="margin:0;font-size:19px;line-height:1.7;color:#2B2622">At JBG, we will also reduce your long-term costs by helping you avoid costly repairs. If a gas line breaks down the road, you will not only have to pay money to have it fixed, but you'll also likely have to shut down your business. Every minute that your business is not open results in lost income.</p><p style="margin:0;font-size:19px;line-height:1.7;color:#2B2622">Choosing our team of trusted professionals will reduce your chance of costly future repairs. We treat our customers like family, which is why we've gained such notoriety and recognition across Texas over the past three decades. Hiring us ensures that your project will be completed the right way the first time.</p></div></div></section>
<section style="background:#fff;padding:clamp(56px,7vw,100px) 20px"><div style="max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto"><h2 style="margin:0 0 20px;text-align:center;font-size:clamp(28px,3.8vw,48px);line-height:1.12;font-weight:800;color:#2B2622">We Can Help with All Gas Line Installation Projects</h2><div style="width:60px;height:4px;background:#BD1E2D;margin:0 auto 28px"></div><div style="max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px"><p style="margin:0;font-size:19px;line-height:1.7">Whether you are constructing a brand-new building and have flexibility with your gas installation project or are in dire need of repair, the team at JBG Plumbing will complete the project the right way. No project is too big or too small. Our company appreciates you trusting us with your business, and will not stop working until you are satisfied with your gas installation project.</p><p style="margin:0;font-size:19px;line-height:1.7">If you are interested in a gas line repair or upgrading your existing gas distribution system, there are a few things you'll need to provide, including</p><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;background:#F4F1EE;padding:20px;border-radius:6px"><div style="display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:flex-start;background:#fff;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid #E6E0DA;padding:22px"><span style="flex:0 0 44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:#716558;color:#fff;font-weight:900;font-size:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center">1</span><p style="margin:0;font-size:18px;line-height:1.65;color:#2B2622"><b>The Gas Load</b> – To have a better understanding of your system, we will need to know the connected gas load and the pressure required at the meter outlet.</p></div><div style="display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:flex-start;background:#fff;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid #E6E0DA;padding:22px"><span style="flex:0 0 44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:#716558;color:#fff;font-weight:900;font-size:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center">2</span><p style="margin:0;font-size:18px;line-height:1.65;color:#2B2622"><b>The Gas Service Line</b> – You'll need to have copies of a scaled utility site plan that identifies the footprint of the building and the location of your utilities.</p></div><div style="display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:flex-start;background:#fff;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid #E6E0DA;padding:22px"><span style="flex:0 0 44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:#716558;color:#fff;font-weight:900;font-size:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center">3</span><p style="margin:0;font-size:18px;line-height:1.65;color:#2B2622"><b>The Desired Place for Your New Gas Meter</b> – We can relocate your meter if you'd like.</p></div><div style="display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:flex-start;background:#fff;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid #E6E0DA;padding:22px"><span style="flex:0 0 44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:#716558;color:#fff;font-weight:900;font-size:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center">4</span><p style="margin:0;font-size:18px;line-height:1.65;color:#2B2622"><b>Building Permits</b> – We will have to obtain permits before working on your new gas distribution system. Having your existing permits can help streamline this process.</p></div></div><p style="margin:0;font-size:19px;line-height:1.7">We will then come up with a design that fits into your existing structure. If possible, we will avoid additional costs, such as building reconstruction. It's important to note that the new system will have to clear engineer approval. Load requirements determine whether engineer approval is granted.</p></div></div></section>
<section style="background:#F4F1EE;padding:clamp(56px,7vw,100px) 20px"><div style="max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto"><p style="margin:0 auto 32px;max-width:1000px;text-align:center;font-size:19px;line-height:1.7;color:#2B2622">Your commercial gas line installation is just as important to us as it is you. At JBG, we offer more than plumbing services. Several businesses in the area have trusted us over the years, including:</p><div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:var(--brandCols);gap:18px"><div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E6E0DA;border-radius:6px;padding:22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;min-width:0"><span style="font-weight:900;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:18px;line-height:1.2;color:#2B2622">Hopdoddy Burger Bar</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#3A3530">a Texas-based restaurant that delivers burgers made of fresh, all-natural ingredients.</span></div><div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E6E0DA;border-radius:6px;padding:22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;min-width:0"><span style="font-weight:900;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:18px;line-height:1.2;color:#2B2622">Nothing Bundt Cakes</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#3A3530">an expanding bakery chain.</span></div><div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E6E0DA;border-radius:6px;padding:22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;min-width:0"><span style="font-weight:900;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:18px;line-height:1.2;color:#2B2622">Kirkland's</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#3A3530">a retail chain that sells home décor and specializes in furnishings.</span></div><div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E6E0DA;border-radius:6px;padding:22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;min-width:0"><span style="font-weight:900;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:18px;line-height:1.2;color:#2B2622">IHOP</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#3A3530">a restaurant chain that specializes in breakfast foods</span></div><div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E6E0DA;border-radius:6px;padding:22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;min-width:0"><span style="font-weight:900;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:18px;line-height:1.2;color:#2B2622">European Wax Center</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#3A3530">a major chain of hair removal salons in the United States</span></div><div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E6E0DA;border-radius:6px;padding:22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;min-width:0"><span style="font-weight:900;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:18px;line-height:1.2;color:#2B2622">Foot Locker</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#3A3530">one of the top Woolworth Company brands</span></div><div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E6E0DA;border-radius:6px;padding:22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;min-width:0"><span style="font-weight:900;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:18px;line-height:1.2;color:#2B2622">Texas Road House</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#3A3530">a chain restaurant that specializes in steaks and promotes a Western theme</span></div><div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E6E0DA;border-radius:6px;padding:22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;min-width:0"><span style="font-weight:900;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:18px;line-height:1.2;color:#2B2622">Gold's Gym</span><span style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#3A3530">an American chain of international co-ed fitness centers</span></div></div><div style="margin-top:32px"><div style="max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px"><p style="margin:0;font-size:19px;line-height:1.7;color:#2B2622">We focus on providing performance, value, and personal attention to each commercial gas line installation project. We are flexible and can promptly complete a project within your financial requirements. Our commercial worksites are well-organized and highly efficient, making us the most attractive contractor in Texas.</p></div></div></div></section>
